<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mancon six-mth net up 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mancon six-mth net up 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  12.53   vs	   8.63</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 30.5    vs	  21.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		   312.22   vs	 202.03</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    23.11   vs	  17.48</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  3.55   vs  less   3.00</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Mancon Bhd. It is involved in civil engineering and building contracting works.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
